// Self-written filters, tags and a content level for engine tests.

== filter feral
name: Feral
group: Creatures
description: Animals and animal-shaped creatures.

== filter noncon
name: Non-consent
group: Themes
description: Sex without consent.

== tag canine
name: Canine
group: Species
description: Dogs and wolves.

== level detail
name: Detail
description: How long scenes are.
default: standard
options:
    less: Shorter scenes.
    standard: Normal scenes.
    more: Longer scenes, with extra description.
